## Why suspended (firing condition) — continue-and-observe
Continue-and-observe: I detached the review DAG and **self-suspend at zero token cost** until it folds, rather than block the loop. Resumption condition: the **forked-thread-completion firing condition on thread id `review-ferric-foundation`** (its `SYNTHESIS.md` / terminal record observable at `taskflow/dags/review-ferric-foundation/SYNTHESIS.md`). On discharge the engine resumes this node (templating `CONTINUE.md`), I1 reaches COMPLETED, and `overseer/I2` (depends_on I1) becomes eligible to run the review gate + land/remediate. `thread_evaluation = Continue` (published mid-flight): the chain advances, it does not exit — the engagement is far from done (foundation not yet landed; board not all Done).

